# cloak/travel: the hooded Travel cloak (OUTER, P2b wave 2), to the calves, the hood thrown back in a lump at the nape;
# the shoulder drapes and the cord are cloak/travel_front.
# It hangs behind the body (over it facing up) and rides the hang channel, so every clip's hang key moves it with the
# skirts: the hem sways by whole rows on the front and back walks (sway 6), kicks back on the side walk's contact frames
# (wide), flies in the run (flare), folds on a seat (sit) or a saddle (ride), pools on the ground (kneel, floor) and lies spread
# under a corpse (lie). 20 px across, 16 px deep at most, so the cloaked look's atlases stay near B10's budgets.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role cloak travel
layer cloakBack
anchor neck
keys hang
sway 6
legend Q cloak 0
legend R cloak 1
legend S cloak 2
legend T cloak 3
legend U cloak 4

